# Survey-Adjust sample: a small 3D total-station network (synthetic data).
# A and B are fixed control; C, D and E are computed. Two rounds from every station.
# Suggested instrument: distance 0.0007 m + 2 ppm, direction 3", zenith 3", no centering error.
.UNITS METERS
.UNITS DMS
.ORDER NE
.ORDER ATFROMTO
.3D
.CURVE ON
.REF 0.07

C A 5000.000 5000.000 120.000 ! ! ! 'CONTROL A
C B 5090.500 5130.200 121.400 ! ! ! 'CONTROL B

